e members. The form posts with a CSRF token; a refusal re-shows the form with HTTP 422 and the message under the field (aria-invalid, aria-describedby). Success redirects with HTTP 303 and a confirmation naming the due date. Item and member names link to their detail pages (WF 08, WF 05). Admin role only (BR 10)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8a969b;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="706" width="1110" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>